      Q. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلْقَمَهُ</span></b>  <i>He cut,</i> or <i>severed, his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُلْقُوم</span>
[q. v. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلْقٌ</span>]. (Msb, See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حلقم</span>.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلْقَمَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلْقَنَ</span>: see 2. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْلَقَ</span>, (TA,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْلَقَةٌ</span>, (S,) <i>He said</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ إِلَّا بِٱللّٰهِ</span>:
[see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حول</span>:] so says ISk: (S:) others say
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْقَلَ</span>. (IAth, TA.)

